Pink, fleshy things resembling naked mole rats, [[Ugathal]] are recognisable chiefly by what they lack — faces whose eyes sink into the sockets and whose other features melt away into the skin. When they transform, they grow roughly a foot and a half and their clothes fuse into the body, after which a proboscis extends from that blank face to drain blood from victims. They feel no pain, and damage merely makes them lose form — their stringy flesh holds no blood, only more flesh beneath.
